1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 22=

4
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:03,390
Zhao Boqing.

5
00:01:21,190 --> 00:01:24,060
♪Lies woven from schemes in the mire♪

6
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:25,980
♪Have trapped our fate♪

7
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,880
♪The tangled knot between love and hate♪

8
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:33,140
♪Shatters beneath your blade♪

9
00:01:33,790 --> 00:01:34,510
Zhao Boqing.

10
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,430
In this life,

11
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:38,710
you are not allowed to die before me.

12
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:43,890
♪If all our past is forgotten♪

13
00:01:44,060 --> 00:01:47,470
♪Leaving only longing behind♪

14
00:01:48,630 --> 00:01:51,440
♪Let the Lovers' Gu bind you and me♪

15
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:54,240
♪Even in pain, let me be closer to you♪

16
00:01:54,390 --> 00:02:00,970
♪Can this fleeting sweetness
last a little longer?♪

17
00:02:01,220 --> 00:02:05,610
♪Just let me indulge one last time♪

18
00:02:05,610 --> 00:02:07,850
♪In your gentle eyes♪

19
00:02:08,130 --> 00:02:11,130
♪How lingering our final kiss is♪

20
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:14,460
♪May we never meet in the next life♪

21
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:18,450
♪Your blade
sets my heart's blood ablaze♪

22
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:21,810
♪Piercing through
everything in this dream♪

23
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:24,360
♪You are the thought I cannot let go♪

24
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:28,350
♪With no answer in this life♪

25
00:02:28,690 --> 00:02:33,000
♪So let the dream
be cast into the flames♪

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,300
♪And brought to an end♪

27
00:02:35,570 --> 00:02:39,860
♪Burn away the snowstorm in my memories♪

28
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:42,210
♪And that deception♪

29
00:02:42,370 --> 00:02:46,740
♪Just let me indulge one last time♪

30
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:49,000
♪In your gentle eyes♪

31
00:02:49,250 --> 00:02:52,250
♪How lingering our final kiss is♪

32
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:55,750
♪In the next life, we shall never meet♪

33
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,080
Careful.

34
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:11,560
Xiaoyuan.

35
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:35,030
♪One thought of youth, laughing side
by side, I made a promise with you♪

36
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:38,680
Didn't the Imperial Physician say

37
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,470
that to remove the Gu,

38
00:03:40,710 --> 00:03:42,190
I had to draw it out with my blood

39
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,910
and into my body?

40
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:45,360
Why are they...

41
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:49,910
Because the love Gu is gone.

42
00:03:50,470 --> 00:03:51,240
He Xiaoyuan.

43
00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:53,750
I remember everything now.

44
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:57,150
I remember it all.

45
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,430
In our last life,

46
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:02,240
I had never devoted so much

47
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,400
to anyone before.

48
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,360
How could I forget?

49
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,520
How could I possibly forget?

50
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:16,420
♪Remembering a past life,
with no regrets for this chapter♪

51
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:23,490
♪Can I still hope
that someday we'll meet again?♪

52
00:04:24,250 --> 00:04:28,510
♪Can I still hope that someday♪

53
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:35,350
♪We'll meet again?♪

54
00:04:45,310 --> 00:04:46,160
Father.

55
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:49,190
The case of Boqing colluding
with merchants has been confirmed.

56
00:04:49,870 --> 00:04:51,310
He has shut himself away all day.

57
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,950
I'm afraid he may act
out of fear of punishment.

58
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,040
Father.

59
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,560
I request an audience.

60
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,870
The Seventh Prince seeks an audience.

61
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,120
Father.

62
00:05:07,510 --> 00:05:08,600
The three-day deadline has passed.

63
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,560
I have arrested
Canal Transport Commissioner Zhang Qian

64
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,600
and his accomplices.

65
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,120
He embezzled military funds

66
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,480
and forged the jade token to frame me.

67
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,390
His confession and the ledgers are here.

68
00:05:24,020 --> 00:05:26,380
(Criminal. Zhang Qian)

69
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,680
Crown Prince.

70
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,270
You recommended Zhang Qian.

71
00:05:31,630 --> 00:05:32,750
I failed to keep
my subordinate in check.

72
00:05:33,210 --> 00:05:34,260
I accept whatever punishment
you see fit, Father.

73
00:05:34,790 --> 00:05:35,390
Boqing.

74
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,560
You've rendered a great service.

75
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,120
What reward do you want?

76
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,270
Father.

77
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,120
I ask only one thing.

78
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:44,120
Please allow me

79
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:46,560
to marry He Xiaoyuan,
the Princess's Study Companion.

80
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,600
Father.

81
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:50,870
He Xiaoyuan

82
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:52,720
is my future Crown Princess.

83
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:53,510
Boqing.

84
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,680
By doing this,

85
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,190
have you no regard for propriety?

86
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:58,600
She has neither been formally
appointed nor married into the family.

87
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,270
How can she
be called the Crown Princess?

88
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:01,800
Enough!

89
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,240
A mere study companion

90
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,310
has made both of you

91
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,070
lose your composure

92
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,160
before me like this.

93
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:17,000
You are quite resourceful, Boqing.

94
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,600
It seems you didn't just break the Gu.

95
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,240
You've even remembered things

96
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,160
you were never supposed to remember.

97
00:06:23,270 --> 00:06:24,070
That's right.

98
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:26,750
Whatever arrangement you made

99
00:06:26,750 --> 00:06:28,480
with Zhixuan,

100
00:06:29,190 --> 00:06:30,920
he created the situation
we now find ourselves in.

101
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,830
My advice to you

102
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:33,750
comes down to four words.

103
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:35,000
Don't bargain with tigers.

104
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,270
You're the last person
qualified to say that.

105
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,160
Zhao Boqing.

106
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:40,750
You survived this ordeal.

107
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,920
Consider yourself lucky.

108
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:43,600
There's still a long road ahead.

109
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,750
We'll see what happens.

110
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,120
Very well.

111
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,390
As long as you don't endanger
our loved ones or the realm,

112
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:51,040
I

113
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,680
will be ready for whatever
you have planned.

114
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,190
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

115
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,310
At this family banquet,

116
00:07:01,510 --> 00:07:03,000
what I wish to see

117
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,310
is harmony between brothers.

118
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:06,720
She's only one woman.

119
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,430
She's not worth causing a rift between

120
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,680
two princes of Great Yue.

121
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,000
With this cup,

122
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:15,870
I hope you will set aside
your past grievances

123
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,720
and safeguard the realm together.

124
00:07:26,860 --> 00:07:28,300
Father is absolutely right.

125
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:29,380
Boqing.

126
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:31,260
This cup

127
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:32,700
is to you.

128
00:07:32,860 --> 00:07:33,860
May the two of us

129
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:34,660
from this day forward

130
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:35,700
stand united

131
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:36,780
and serve Father together.

132
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:48,500
- We will heed your teachings, Father.
- We will heed your teachings, Father.

133
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:51,260
- May you live long and well, Father.
- May you live long and well, Father.

134
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:52,220
Good.

135
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:01,220
Father.

136
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:04,580
Father!

137
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:06,200
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

138
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:07,940
Father!

139
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:08,620
Boqing.

140
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:09,070
Father!

141
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,180
Why did you try to kill Father?

142
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:11,740
You were in charge of everything

143
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:13,140
for this Mid-Autumn palace banquet.

144
00:08:13,140 --> 00:08:14,020
Other than you,

145
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:16,220
who else could have tampered
with Father's wine?

146
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:21,300
Your Highness.

147
00:08:21,860 --> 00:08:22,740
I can no longer bear

148
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:24,100
to keep this secret.

149
00:08:25,780 --> 00:08:26,500
The Seventh Prince

150
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:28,900
has long been secretly
stockpiling weapons and armor

151
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:30,620
and maintaining close ties
with border commanders.

152
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:31,200
I...

153
00:08:32,060 --> 00:08:33,180
I tried to dissuade him many times,

154
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:34,740
but His Highness refused to listen.

155
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:35,540
Today,

156
00:08:35,900 --> 00:08:37,260
he has committed an even graver offense.

157
00:08:37,820 --> 00:08:38,260
I...

158
00:08:39,140 --> 00:08:40,500
I can no longer help him
commit such wrongdoing.

159
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:42,380
Zhao Boqing!

160
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:44,540
Fu Yang is your personal attendant.

161
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:46,060
What else do you have to say?

162
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:47,020
Fu Yang.

163
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,620
The traitor Zhao Boqing

164
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:52,380
poisoned His Majesty

165
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:54,420
and plotted to seize the throne.

166
00:08:54,420 --> 00:08:55,580
The evidence is conclusive.

167
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:56,700
Guards!

168
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,580
Seize him!

169
00:09:06,300 --> 00:09:07,420
You've worked hard

170
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:10,060
to set all this up,

171
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:10,860
Your Highness.

172
00:09:12,660 --> 00:09:14,860
(Wenhua Hall)

173
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:17,780
Let go!

174
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:19,580
Let me out!

175
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:20,980
Out?

176
00:09:21,860 --> 00:09:23,700
So you can go find
that prisoner Zhao Boqing?

177
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:25,460
He Xiaoyuan.

178
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:27,300
Don't you understand?

179
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:29,500
From the moment
you entered the Eastern Palace,

180
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:31,860
you could only
ever be my Crown Princess.

181
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:37,140
You fled our wedding in the last life.

182
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:38,340
In this life,

183
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:40,020
you're not going anywhere.

184
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:54,060
Whether you like it or not,

185
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:56,540
three days from now
is an auspicious day.

186
00:09:56,620 --> 00:09:58,180
The Ministry of Rites has already
arranged the wedding ceremony.

187
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:59,620
Starting tomorrow,

188
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:02,660
you will stay in the Eastern Palace

189
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:04,780
and learn the wedding rites.

190
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:14,900
Keep an eye on her.

191
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:15,960
Your Highness.

192
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,320
Well...

193
00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:18,700
You can't force someone to love you.

194
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:20,260
Even so, she'll still be mine.

195
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:22,980
Fine. She's yours.

196
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:34,300
Get out.

197
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:36,180
You can't even dress a wound properly.

198
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:47,500
Your Highness has finally
gotten what you wanted.

199
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:49,500
Why get angry over a little wound?

200
00:10:59,090 --> 00:10:59,740
Don't move.

201
00:11:03,180 --> 00:11:05,180
So even the Crown Prince
is afraid of pain.

202
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:06,940
Mu Tingting.

203
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:08,540
If it were you,

204
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:10,540
would you choose
the Seventh Prince or me?

205
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:12,340
I...

206
00:11:14,140 --> 00:11:15,140
I wouldn't choose either of you.

207
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:17,540
A man's heart
is the least dependable thing.

208
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:19,380
Today, he may
love you with all his heart,

209
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:20,380
but tomorrow,

210
00:11:20,380 --> 00:11:21,400
he may cast you aside
without a second thought.

211
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:24,060
If a woman wants to live well,

212
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:27,020
she ultimately has to rely on
the money in her own hands.

213
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:30,580
Very well.

214
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:33,340
So money is all
you care about, Mu Tingting.

215
00:11:35,130 --> 00:11:35,910
I have

216
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:37,660
nothing for you to do today,

217
00:11:37,860 --> 00:11:39,300
and certainly no reward for you.

218
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:40,580
Why are you here?

219
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:42,580
To say goodbye.

220
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:54,710
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

221
00:11:55,070 --> 00:11:56,750
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

222
00:11:57,390 --> 00:12:00,390
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

223
00:12:00,910 --> 00:12:05,230
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

224
00:12:05,230 --> 00:12:07,990
♪My heart has long known♪

225
00:12:08,430 --> 00:12:10,430
♪We made a promise long ago♪

226
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,350
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

227
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:16,350
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

228
00:12:16,670 --> 00:12:19,510
♪How much must I let go♪

229
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:21,510
♪For one moment♪

230
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:24,510
♪To hold each other close♪

231
00:12:24,750 --> 00:12:29,070
♪Would that be enough?♪
